          "headersSize": -1,
          "bodySize": 1416,
          "postData": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"text\":\"I tried to start a new discussion over the \\\"New to GitHub\\\" category, found listed in this webpage: https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/new/choose. \\n\\nAfter I clicked the \\\"Get Started\\\" button, I was redirected to [a webpage](https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/new?category=new-to-github) with a two field form, Add a title, and Add a body. \\n\\n![Screenshot 2026-10-20 130920.png](https://github.zendesk.com/attachments/token/CmarDwMID7QEjK7q8XbTzc4dS/?name=Screenshot+2026-10-20+130920.png)\\n\\nI filled up both, and after I published my question, a GitHub bot closed my question claiming I am required to use the UI interface and the required template. \\n\\n![2026-10-20_12-51-59_GitHub-community-New_to_GitHub-question-closed-by-bot-who-claimed-template-wrong-but-marked-as-outdated.png](https://github.zendesk.com/attachments/token/Q58qFqW8K3sQIMd3Avm3kuGXE/?name=2026-10-20_12-51-59_GitHub-community-New_to_GitHub-question-closed-by-bot-who-claimed-template-wrong-but-marked-as-outdated.png)\\n\\nThe bot that closed my question, marked the it as \\\"Outdated\\\"\\n\\n I am a target of persistent hacking and I think hackers actually did something for this to happen. \\n\\nHere you can see a screen recording of the process I just described : https://cybertrapped.substack.com/p/2026-10-20-disabled-from-publishing\\n\\nWhat am I doing wrong?\\n\\nWhat template should I have used?\\n\\nThanx\"}"
          }
        },
